, preparing supplies for special examinations and ordering supplies when necessary.","core":true,"importance":4.17,"relevance":99.42,"frequency":5.39},{"id":444,"text":"Perform legal and ethical duties, including preparing safety or accident reports, obtaining written consent from patient to perform invasive procedures, or reporting symptoms of abuse or neglect.","core":true,"importance":4.09,"relevance":78.38,"frequency":3.8}],"activities":[{"id":"4.A.4.a.5","importance":4.68},{"id":"4.A.2.b.3","importance":4.67},{"id":"4.A.1.a.1","importance":4.49},{"id":"4.A.4.a.2","importance":4.36},{"id":"4.A.3.a.3","importance":4.21},{"id":"4.A.3.b.6","importance":4.2},{"id":"4.A.1.b.1","importance":3.98},{"id":"4.A.2.b.1","importance":3.88},{"id":"4.A.3.a.2","importance":3.85},{"id":"4.A.1.b.2","importance":3.81},{"id":"4.A.2.a.2","importance":3.74},{"id":"4.A.4.a.8","importance":3.71},{"id":"4.A.2.b.5","importance":3.64},{"id":"4.A.2.a.4","importance":3.54},{"id":"4.A.3.b.1","importance":3.54},{"id":"4.A.2.a.1","importance":3.48},{"id":"4.A.4.a.4","importance":3.47},{"id":"4.A.2.b.6","importance":3.42},{"id":"4.A.4.a.1","importance":3.39},{"id":"4.A.2.a.3","importance":3.29},{"id":"4.A.4.b.3","importance":3.2},{"id":"4.A.2.b.4","importance":3.14},{"id":"4.A.2.b.2","importance":3.06},{"id":"4.A.3.a.1","importance":3.01},{"id":"4.A.4.b.1","importance":2.85},{"id":"4.A.1.a.2","importance":2.83},{"id":"4.A.4.a.7","importance":2.82},{"id":"4.A.4.b.5","importance":2.78},{"id":"4.A.1.b.3","importance":2.76},{"id":"4.A.3.a.4","importance":2.41},{"id":"4.A.4.b.2","importance":2.36},{"id":"4.A.4.c.1","importance":2.22},{"id":"4.A.4.b.6","importance":2.18},{"id":"4.A.4.b.4","importance":2.15},{"id":"4.A.4.a.6","importance":2.1},{"id":"4.A.4.c.3","importance":2},{"id":"4.A.3.b.5","importance":1.81},{"id":"4.A.3.b.4","importance":1.77},{"id":"4.A.4.a.3","importance":1.68},{"id":"4.A.4.c.2","importance":1.4},{"id":"4.A.3.b.2","importance":1.19}],"context":[{"id":"4.C.1.a.2.c","mean":1.33,